1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Your timing belt can fail

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
with zero warning light.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
No check-engine light.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
It's mileage-based, not warning-based.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Most belts are due between

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
60,000 and 100,000 miles.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
On some engines, a snapped belt

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
can mean serious engine damage.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Don't wait for a light that isn't coming.

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — free check. Link in bio.
